  "project_description": "This module provides a flexible way to create visually rich text overlays with background image.\n\n It allows editors to place text on top of images with configurable positioning options such as top-left, center, or bottom-right. The module focuses on simplicity and usability while still offering enough control for common design needs.\n\n Key features include: \n \n Add text overlays to images \n Predefined positioning (e.g., 9-point grid like top-left, center, bottom-right) or free drag to custom position \n Responsive behavior of the text \n \n The module is designed to be lightweight and developer-friendly, making it easy to extend or customize for advanced use cases.",
